~ dinner_time
set State.can_move = false
[wait=1.0]
Mom: [speed=0.8]It’s finally quiet...[/speed] 
Mom: I feel like I haven't seen all of you in the same room for ages. [wait=0.8]
Dad: [speed=0.6]Work has been heavy lately. [wait=0.5] But tonight... tonight we just eat.[/speed]

You: ...
[wait=0.5]
Child: [wave amp=15.0 freq=2.0]The soup is [color=ffebad]warm[/color].[/wave]
Child: I like it when we’re like this. [wait=1.0]

Dad: We all do, kiddo. [wait=0.8]
Mom: [speed=0.5][color=ffadad]Eat slowly.[/color][/speed] No one is going anywhere.
Mom: We have all the time in the world.

You: (It feels so real...)
You: (The smell... the steam... I don't want to leave.)

[wait=2.0]
# The dramatic shift starts here
Dad: [speed=0.3]Why are you crying?[/speed] [wait=1.5]
You: ... [wait=1.0]
Mom: [speed=0.4]Don't worry...[/speed] [wait=1.0]
Mom: [speed=0.2]It’s okay to [wave]wake up[/wave] now.[/speed]

[wait=2.0]
=> END

